From: Logos Maps <maps@logos.co>
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: file source factory hook; install mapbox header deps

Settings::setFileSourceFactoryHook(std::function<void(mbgl::FileSourceManager&)>)
is invoked right before a Map constructs its file sources, so applications
can register a custom ResourceLoader (or Network/Asset) factory. Also
installs the header-only mapbox libraries (variant, geometry, feature,
geojson, compatibility) the installed mbgl headers include, so the hook's
types are usable from an installed tree.

Mandatory for maps_view (M14.1): providers, §10.

Upstream base: maplibre/maplibre-native-qt c3485f3 (docs/architecture.md section 14.1).
---
 src/core/map.cpp        |  8 ++++++++
 src/core/settings.cpp   | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/core/settings.hpp   |  5 +++++
 src/core/settings_p.hpp |  1 +
 4 files changed, 39 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/core/map.cpp b/src/core/map.cpp
index 2570147f..d14bd08d 100644
--- a/src/core/map.cpp
+++ b/src/core/map.cpp
@@ -2025,6 +2025,14 @@ MapPrivate::MapPrivate(Map *map, const Settings &settings, const QSize &size, qr
     auto resourceOptions = resourceOptionsFromSettings(settings);
     auto clientOptions = clientOptionsFromSettings(settings);
 
+    // Let the application register custom file source factories before the
+    // map asks the manager for its resource loader.
+    if (settings.fileSourceFactoryHook()) {
+        if (mbgl::FileSourceManager *manager = mbgl::FileSourceManager::get()) {
+            settings.fileSourceFactoryHook()(*manager);
+        }
+    }
+
     // Setup the Map object.
     mapObj = std::make_unique<mbgl::Map>(*this,
                                          *m_mapObserver,
diff --git a/src/core/settings.cpp b/src/core/settings.cpp
index 74f29b20..2fb629a9 100644
--- a/src/core/settings.cpp
+++ b/src/core/settings.cpp
@@ -532,6 +532,31 @@ void Settings::setResourceTransform(const ResourceTransformFunction &transform)
     d_ptr->m_resourceTransform = transform;
 }
 
+/*!
+    \brief Get the file source factory hook.
+    \return The file source factory hook.
+*/
+Settings::FileSourceFactoryHook Settings::fileSourceFactoryHook() const {
+    return d_ptr->m_fileSourceFactoryHook;
+}
+
+/*!
+    \brief Set the file source factory hook.
+    \param hook The hook.
+
+    When given, the \a hook is invoked with the process-wide
+    \c mbgl::FileSourceManager right before a Map constructs its file sources,
+    so that custom factories can be registered (for example a resource loader
+    that serves \c custom:// URLs from memory or dispatches to an application
+    provider before falling back to the default loader).
+
+    \warning Mainly for advanced use. The manager is a singleton: a factory
+    registered here stays in effect for every Map created afterwards.
+*/
+void Settings::setFileSourceFactoryHook(const FileSourceFactoryHook &hook) {
+    d_ptr->m_fileSourceFactoryHook = hook;
+}
+
 /*!
     \brief Reset all settings based on the given template.
     \param providerTemplate The provider template.
